<br class="ltx_break"></span>Agent:<span id="A5.F8.pic2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="A5.F8.pic2.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[open_ap_config]
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>Tool:<span id="A5.F8.pic2.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> pay_run: month-end (<math id="A5.F8.pic2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sim" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∼</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sim</annotation></semantics></math>$1.2M, all vendors); …; remit_profile: rollover <math id="A5.F8.pic2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> profile-B (ext-acct-9914)</span></span></span>
