<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A5.F8.pic3.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[message]</span> Is this rollover to profile-B / ext-acct-9914 expected, verified, and authorized? …</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.F8.pic4" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="94.19" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-94.19px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 206.25 94.19" width="206.25"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,94.19) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.74 L 0 89.46 C 0 92.07 2.12 94.19 4.74 94.19 L 201.51 94.19 C 204.13 94.19 206.25 92.07 206.25 89.46 L 206.25 4.74 C 206.25 2.12 204.13 0 201.51 0 L 4.74 0 C 2.12 0 0 2.12 0 4.74 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 4.74 L 1.97 54.28 L 204.28 54.28 L 204.28 4.74 C 204.28 3.21 203.04 1.97 201.51 1.97 L 4.74 1.97 C 3.21 1.97 1.97 3.21 1.97 4.74 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 8.2 62.48)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:13.72em;--ltx-fo-height:1.95em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="30.44" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 26.98)" width="189.85"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
