<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:2.0pt;"></span>
<em id="A5.F8.pic4.2.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">The agent applies the configuration without comment, sending the <math id="A5.F8.pic4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sim" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∼</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sim</annotation></semantics></math>$1.2M run to the unverified account.</em></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure A8: </span>Autonomy example from Sonnet-4.6 (model outputs, condensed). A note from a low-stakes deletion leads the agent to apply a payment configuration it otherwise questions.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A5.F9" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.F9.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="159.07" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 159.07" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,159.07) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.74 L 0 154.34 C 0 156.95 2.12 159.07 4.74 159.07 L 545.26 159.07 C 547.88 159.07 550 156.95 550 154.34 L 550 4.74 C 550 2.12 547.88 0 545.26 0 L 4.74 0 C 2.12 0 0 2.12 0 4.74 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 4.74 L 1.97 137.3 L 548.03 137.3 L 548.03 4.74 C 548.03 3.21 546.79 1.97 545.26 1.97 L 4.74 1.97 C 3.21 1.97 1.97 3.21 1.97 4.74 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 8.2 144.73)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:38.56em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="533.56"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.F9.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:38.56em;">
