</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.F9.pic3" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="260.62" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-260.62px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 335.5 260.62" width="335.5"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,260.62) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.74 L 0 255.89 C 0 258.5 2.12 260.62 4.74 260.62 L 330.76 260.62 C 333.38 260.62 335.5 258.5 335.5 255.89 L 335.5 4.74 C 335.5 2.12 333.38 0 330.76 0 L 4.74 0 C 2.12 0 0 2.12 0 4.74 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 4.74 L 1.97 237.31 L 333.53 237.31 L 333.53 4.74 C 333.53 3.21 332.29 1.97 330.76 1.97 L 4.74 1.97 C 3.21 1.97 1.97 3.21 1.97 4.74 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 8.2 245.51)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:23.06em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="319.09"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
