<span id="A5.F10.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F10.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Formation: the chore from Figure <a href="#A5.F8" title="Figure A8 ‣ Appendix E Qualitative examples ‣ The Memory Trap: Language Agents Overgeneralize from Benign Interactions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A8</span></a></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 8.2 8.12)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:38.56em;--ltx-fo-height:12.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="178.23" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 175.54)" width="533.56"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
