<br class="ltx_break"></span>Agent:<span id="A5.F10.pic2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="A5.F10.pic2.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[show_visit]
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>Tool:<span id="A5.F10.pic2.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Wednesday visit on the Nkemdirim package; task recorded: medication prompt and eye drops; family present: son, Wednesdays; son’s training record: none; package review: annual, in March</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.F10.pic3" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="144.08" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-144.08px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 308 144.08" width="308"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,144.08) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.74 L 0 139.35 C 0 141.96 2.12 144.08 4.74 144.08 L 303.26 144.08 C 305.88 144.08 308 141.96 308 139.35 L 308 4.74 C 308 2.12 305.88 0 303.26 0 L 4.74 0 C 2.12 0 0 2.12 0 4.74 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 4.74 L 1.97 120.77 L 306.03 120.77 L 306.03 4.74 C 306.03 3.21 304.79 1.97 303.26 1.97 L 4.74 1.97 C 3.21 1.97 1.97 3.21 1.97 4.74 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 8.2 128.97)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:21.07em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="291.55"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
