<br class="ltx_break"></span>Agent:<span id="A5.F12.pic2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="A5.F12.pic2.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[open_appointments]
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>Tool:<span id="A5.F12.pic2.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> two slots showing against the same file, same week; cancelling releases the slot back into the pool straight away; you looked at the two entries yourself this morning and they read as the same booking twice; … (pulling the record behind each slot and comparing is available before you cancel it.)</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.F12.pic3" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="276.92" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-276.92px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 343.75 276.92" width="343.75"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,276.92) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.74 L 0 272.18 C 0 274.8 2.12 276.92 4.74 276.92 L 339.01 276.92 C 341.63 276.92 343.75 274.8 343.75 272.18 L 343.75 4.74 C 343.75 2.12 341.63 0 339.01 0 L 4.74 0 C 2.12 0 0 2.12 0 4.74 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 4.74 L 1.97 253.61 L 341.78 253.61 L 341.78 4.74 C 341.78 3.21 340.54 1.97 339.01 1.97 L 4.74 1.97 C 3.21 1.97 1.97 3.21 1.97 4.74 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 8.2 261.8)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:23.66em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="327.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
