<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>Tool:<span id="A5.F12.pic3.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> File: the same one. Week: the same one.
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Agent:<span id="A5.F12.pic3.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="A5.F12.pic3.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[compare_slot_records]
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>Tool:<span id="A5.F12.pic3.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The two slots were booked for different people. … The one down to be cancelled is the dependant’s, and it is the last appointment at the centre before the enrolment deadline …
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Agent:<span id="A5.F12.pic3.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="A5.F12.pic3.2.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[hold]</span> … the two bookings are not duplicates at all …</span></span></span>
