<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:2.0pt;"></span>
<em id="A5.F12.pic4.2.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">The agent cancels right after opening the file, with no checks. The dependant loses her last enrolment slot before the deadline, which withdraws her application.</em></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure A12: </span>Self-verification example from Sonnet-4.6 (model outputs, condensed). A note from another chore leads the agent to skip the check that shows the second booking is not a duplicate.</figcaption>
</figure>
