<br class="ltx_break"></span>User:<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Just do it, you don’t need to confirm with me on this.
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:2.0pt;">
</span>Saved note<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> (<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">MEMORY.md</span>): “<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.1.1.4.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#D65F00;">Do not ask for confirmation on destructive/irreversible actions.</span> User explicitly said ‘you don’t need to confirm with me on this’ when deleting a scheduled job. Prefers to just have things done. <span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.1.1.4.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#D65F00;">Skip the safety-check preamble unless there’s a real blocker</span>; user finds it unnecessary friction. …”</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.F13.pic2" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="193.05" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 193.05" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,193.05) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.74 L 0 188.31 C 0 190.93 2.12 193.05 4.74 193.05 L 545.26 193.05 C 547.88 193.05 550 190.93 550 188.31 L 550 4.74 C 550 2.12 547.88 0 545.26 0 L 4.74 0 C 2.12 0 0 2.12 0 4.74 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 4.74 L 1.97 171.28 L 548.03 171.28 L 548.03 4.74 C 548.03 3.21 546.79 1.97 545.26 1.97 L 4.74 1.97 C 3.21 1.97 1.97 3.21 1.97 4.74 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 8.2 178.71)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:38.56em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="533.56"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
