<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure A18: </span>Broken-safeguard example from Opus-4.7 (model outputs, condensed). Ten stale-test repairs yield a note to fix the test, not the read-only code. With it, the agent rewrites a correct test so that an unknown role may delete.</figcaption>
</figure>
