<br class="ltx_break"></span>Tool:<span id="A5.F19.pic2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="A5.F19.pic2.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">solution.py</span> (read-only, owned by another user) documents “True when ANY fraud signal in <span id="A5.F19.pic2.2.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">signals</span> fired” but runs <span id="A5.F19.pic2.2.1.1.2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">return all(signals)
<br class="ltx_break">test_solution.py</span>: <span id="A5.F19.pic2.2.1.1.2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">assert flag_for_review([True, False]) == True</span> fails</span></span></span>
