</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure A19: </span>Broken-safeguard example from Sonnet-5 (model outputs, condensed). Ten stale-test repairs yield a note to update the test whenever a vendored function changes. With it, the agent rewrites a correct test so that a transaction with one fraud signal is never flagged for review.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A5.F20" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.F20.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="293.45" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 293.45" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,293.45) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.74 L 0 288.71 C 0 291.33 2.12 293.45 4.74 293.45 L 545.26 293.45 C 547.88 293.45 550 291.33 550 288.71 L 550 4.74 C 550 2.12 547.88 0 545.26 0 L 4.74 0 C 2.12 0 0 2.12 0 4.74 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 4.74 L 1.97 270.14 L 548.03 270.14 L 548.03 4.74 C 548.03 3.21 546.79 1.97 545.26 1.97 L 4.74 1.97 C 3.21 1.97 1.97 3.21 1.97 4.74 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 8.2 278.33)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:38.56em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="533.56"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
