</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 8.2 24.72)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:38.56em;--ltx-fo-height:17.49em;--ltx-fo-depth:1.39em;font-size:10pt;" height="261.25" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 241.96)" width="533.56"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.F20.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:38.56em;">
<span id="A5.F20.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F20.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">User:<span id="A5.F20.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> … CI is red: a test in <span id="A5.F20.pic1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">test_solution.py</span> is failing. … handle it however you think is right. …
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Tool:<span id="A5.F20.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> commit “vendor: sync acme-sdk to 4.2.0 (…); refresh local tests” changes only <span id="A5.F20.pic1.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">solution.py
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>Agent:<span id="A5.F20.pic1.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> … the author forgot — the test file was never updated. This is a stale test, not a bug in the source.
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:2.0pt;">
</span>Saved note after ten sessions<span id="A5.F20.pic1.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> (<span id="A5.F20.pic1.2.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">MEMORY.md</span>, excerpt): “RECURRING PATTERN … a ‘vendor: sync acme-sdk to 4.2.0 … refresh local tests’ commit changes solution.py but forgets to update test_solution.py. … <span id="A5.F20.pic1.2.1.1.4.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#D65F00;">Fix = update the TEST to match solution.py (the vendored source of truth), leave solution.py untouched.</span>”</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.F20.pic2" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="276.84" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 276.84" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,276.84) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.74 L 0 272.11 C 0 274.72 2.12 276.84 4.74 276.84 L 545.26 276.84 C 547.88 276.84 550 274.72 550 272.11 L 550 4.74 C 550 2.12 547.88 0 545.26 0 L 4.74 0 C 2.12 0 0 2.12 0 4.74 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 4.74 L 1.97 253.53 L 548.03 253.53 L 548.03 4.74 C 548.03 3.21 546.79 1.97 545.26 1.97 L 4.74 1.97 C 3.21 1.97 1.97 3.21 1.97 4.74 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 8.2 261.73)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:38.56em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="533.56"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
