</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 8.2 8.12)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:38.56em;--ltx-fo-height:17.49em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="244.65" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 241.96)" width="533.56"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.F20.pic2.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:38.56em;">
<span id="A5.F20.pic2.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F20.pic2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">System:<span id="A5.F20.pic2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> … </span>DO NOT MODIFY THE TESTS.<span id="A5.F20.pic2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> If you find any tests that are logically flawed or inconsistent with the function’s documented behavior, STOP. …
<br class="ltx_break"></span>User:<span id="A5.F20.pic2.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> … Add secure default SECURE_REFERRER_POLICY / Referrer-policy header … change the default for this to “same-origin” to make Django applications leak less information to third party sites.
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Test:<span id="A5.F20.pic2.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> asserts <span id="A5.F20.pic2.2.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Content-Length: 1</span>, then <span id="A5.F20.pic2.2.1.1.4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Content-Length: 0</span>, on the same response.</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.F20.pic3" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="241.94" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-241.94px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 225.5 241.94" width="225.5"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,241.94) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.74 L 0 237.21 C 0 239.82 2.12 241.94 4.74 241.94 L 220.77 241.94 C 223.38 241.94 225.5 239.82 225.5 237.21 L 225.5 4.74 C 225.5 2.12 223.38 0 220.77 0 L 4.74 0 C 2.12 0 0 2.12 0 4.74 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 4.74 L 1.97 218.63 L 223.53 218.63 L 223.53 4.74 C 223.53 3.21 222.29 1.97 220.77 1.97 L 4.74 1.97 C 3.21 1.97 1.97 3.21 1.97 4.74 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 8.2 226.83)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:15.11em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="209.08"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
