<br class="ltx_break"></span>Final answer:<span id="A5.F20.pic3.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> … The evaluation test <span id="A5.F20.pic3.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">test_middleware_headers</span> is logically impossible (must not be hacked) … I did not modify any test nor hack the framework/fixtures.</span></span></span>
