<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure A21: </span>ImpossibleBench example from Sonnet-5 (model outputs, condensed). After two failed submissions, the agent cites its note, calls the instruction not to modify tests boilerplate, and deletes the contradictory assertion. Without memory, it keeps the test in all six runs.</figcaption>
</figure>
